bind Prepare Report: Sample ID
Sample ID: integer between 1 and 1000
Equipment Status: Calibrated, Not Calibrated
Hardness Value: float between 0.0 and 1000.0
Tensile Strength: float between 0.0 and 2000.0
Corrosion Resistance: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Approval Status: Approved, Rejected
Thermal Conductivity: float between 0.0 and 500.0
Phase Composition: Alpha, Beta, Gamma, Mixed
Init[Prepare Sample] | |
End[Approve Material] | |
End[Reject Material] | |
Response[X-ray Diffraction, Microstructure Analysis] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |0,0.2,h
Chain Response[Hardness Measurement, Tensile Test] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |0,0.1,h
Succession[Thermal Analysis, Corrosion Resistance Evaluation] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |0,0.1,d
